- "Hiraeth" (Wikipedia definition) is a Welsh word that describes a sense of longing, yearning, nostalgia... for something in the past that is no longer here.
- This is the first full-fledged creative writing piece that I have managed to complete since 2019. I had lost the drive to write since then, and I only began to recover it in 2025, culminating in Hiraeth.
